{"slug":"Blocks-n'-Props-Exordum-Hub-34387","_id":"67f26709daffc15eda988653","title":"Exordum Hub","game":{"_id":"67e5e1ffb360710ec3c7817b","gameId":2537430692,"name":"[FIXED] Blocks n' Props","imageUrl":"/images/sb/rbx-e6567d2bfdef6c353a459ef5df94fe9a-743175d76a47.png","placeId":2537430692},"features":"[DISCLAIMER] This script collects some data that includes: Time, Device Type, Executor, and Game Name. No personal or sensitive information is logged.\nAll logs are publicly viewable in the #🧾│execution-logs channel of my Discord server.\nSide Notes: Comment here or message me on discord if you encounter any bugs!\nFeatures:\n* Information Tab:\n- Local Info\n[+] FPS\n[+] Ping\n[+] Time\n- Server Info\n[+] Game\n[+] Player Count\n[+] Server Region\n- Game Info\n[+] Current Destroyer\n[+] Projectile\n[+] Ramp Height\n[+] Projectile Speed\n- Other Info\n[+] ExordumHub's Discord Server link\n[+] Script Version\n[+] Session Time\n* Main Tab:\n- Win (teleport to win button)\n- Auto Win (auto teleport to win button)\n- Reset if Destroyer (auto reset yourself if you are the destroyer)\n* Teleport Tab:\n- Get TP Tool (tool that tp you to where you click)\n- Teleport to (dropdown)\n[+] Destroyer\n[+] Tower\n[+] Spectator Area\n* Anti Tab:\n- Anti AFK (prevents you from getting kicked by afking)\n- Anti KillBrick (remove the killbrick)\n- Safe Platform (make a platform above the killbrick that you can walk on)\n- Anti Fall (teleports you back on the tower if you fall down)\n* Visuals Tab:\n- Projectiles ESP (let you see the projectiles easier)\n- Projectile ESP Outline (choose the esp's outline color)\n- Projectile ESP Fill (choose the esp's fill color)\n* Player Tab:\n- Gravity (change your gravity)\n- Walkspeed (change your walk speed)\n- Loop Walkspeed (keep your walk speed after you die)\n- JumpPower (change your jump power)\n- Loop JumpPower (keep your jump power after you die)\n- Infinite Jump (lets you jump mid air)\n* Misc Tab:\n- Anchor yourself (prevents you from getting pushed whatsoever)\n- Noclip (let you clip through things [and push blocks])\n- Fly (let you fly [great with noclip])\n- View Player (let you spectate other players)\n* Settings Tab:\n- UI Theme (choose the UI's theme)\n- Toggle Key (set the UI's open keybind [this option doesnt appear on mobile])","tags":["Blocks n Props","Free","Keyless","loadstring","script"],"script":"loadstring(game:HttpGet(\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Booger-Aids-V2/Exordum/refs/heads/main/Blocks%20n'%20Props\"))()","owner":{"_id":"67b66af5cc37a3932bb27a6a","username":"Exordum","verified":false,"profilePicture":"/images/photo/67b66af5cc37a3932bb27a6a-1740104794084.PNG","status":"offline","id":"67b66af5cc37a3932bb27a6a","topMilestone":{"key":"creator.first_script","tier":1}},"verified":false,"views":38851,"scriptType":"free","isUniversal":false,"isPatched":false,"visibility":"public","image":"/images/sb/2537430692-1746717556215.png","likeCount":9,"dislikeCount":0,"createdAt":"2025-04-06T11:35:37.699Z","discord":"https://discord.gg/gTtZD3mj","executes":1969,"keyless":false,"liked":false,"disliked":false,"isHub":false,"supportedGames":[],"changelog":[{"_id":"67f26709daffc15eda988655","editBy":{"_id":"67b66af5cc37a3932bb27a6a","username":"Exordum","status":"offline","id":"67b66af5cc37a3932bb27a6a"},"message":"Create script","createdAt":"2025-04-06T11:35:37.700Z"}],"comments":[{"_id":"680b89ff0c691f15c0957ea3","commentBy":{"_id":"67ab5331372107e62e7a23c2","username":"2orb","verified":false,"role":"user","profilePicture":"/images/photo/67ab5331372107e62e7a23c2-1788770545982.png","createdAt":"2025-02-11T13:40:01.467Z","lastActive":"2026-10-09T19:56:30.445Z","status":"offline","id":"67ab5331372107e62e7a23c2","topMilestone":{"key":"creator.first_script","tier":1}},"text":"great script bro W on this one","edited":false,"likeCount":3,"dislikeCount":0,"createdAt":"2025-04-25T13:11:27.676Z","liked":false,"disliked":false},{"_id":"680c4dfccd72b09baddb46fa","commentBy":{"_id":"67b66af5cc37a3932bb